# Error-Driven Plasticity Framework - Commit Template

# [Type]: Brief description (50 chars max)
#
# Types: 
# - feat: New feature or analysis
# - fix: Bug fix or correction
# - docs: Documentation changes
# - style: Code formatting (no logic changes)
# - refactor: Code restructuring (no behavior change)  
# - test: Adding or updating tests
# - data: Parameter updates or data changes
# - paper: Manuscript-related changes
# - repro: Reproducibility improvements
#
# Examples:
# feat: Add cross-scale correlation analysis
# fix: Correct bootstrap sampling procedure  
# docs: Update README with installation guide
# data: Update Allen Observatory parameters
# paper: Incorporate reviewer feedback on methods

# Detailed description (wrap at 72 chars)
# - What changed and why
# - Scientific rationale for changes
# - Impact on results or conclusions
# - References to relevant literature

# Breaking changes (if any):
# - List any incompatible changes
# - Migration instructions

# Paper section affected (if applicable):
# - Methods, Results, Discussion, etc.
# - Specific figure or table changes

# Related issues:
# - Fixes #123
# - Closes #456
# - Related to #789

# Scientific validation:
# - [ ] Results remain statistically significant
# - [ ] Biological parameters still realistic
# - [ ] Code passes all tests
# - [ ] Documentation updated